# HackInMotion 2026 — Presentation Slide Deck (RICR-HIM-1114)
# Project: MediSafe — Smart Medicine Safety & Drug Interaction Assistant
# Track: Healthcare & HealthTech

[SLIDE 1: Title & Problem Statement]
- Project Name: MediSafe
- Team Code: RICR-HIM-1114
- Mission: Prevent Adverse Drug Events (ADEs), Overdose Overlaps & Drug-Drug Interactions using FDA rules and real-time AI.

[SLIDE 2: Core Architecture & Innovation]
- Frontend: React 19 + Vite + Three.js 3D Interactive Organ Models
- Backend: Node.js Express REST APIs + MongoDB Atlas
- Security & Alerts: Fast2SMS OTP Gateway + EmailJS Caregiver Emergency Alerts
- Geospatial Radar: Leaflet + OpenStreetMap Overpass API Live Hospital Finder

[SLIDE 3: Key Features & Live Demonstration]
- 1. Fuzzy Misspelling Medicine Search (e.g. Paracetal -> Paracetamol)
- 2. FDA Active Compound Overdose & Interaction Scanner (High/Medium/Low Risk Classification)
- 3. Interactive 3D Anatomical Organ Canvas (Heart, Lungs, Kidney, Brain, Stomach)
- 4. Live Emergency Hospitals Radar (Browser GPS + Distance calculation)
- 5. Live Day (Light) / Black (Dark) Glassmorphic Design System

[SLIDE 4: Business Viability & Impact]
- Target Audience: Patients on polypharmacy, elderly caregivers, clinics & pharmacies
- Compliance: FDA Clinical Interaction Guidelines & Plain-Language Medical Disclaimers
